# mini-search core dictionary  (whitespace separated; one entry per token)
#
# Purpose: cover the closed-class and high-frequency general vocabulary that a
# corpus-independent analyser must know on day one. Domain vocabulary is NOT
# hand-listed here -- it is mined from the documents themselves by
# dev.jingyu.ms.analyzer.TermMining (frequency + cohesion + branch entropy),
# which is why this file can stay this small and still segment unseen text.
#
# License: written for this project, MIT (same as the code).
#
